(6316931, 935853, 118154, '<td valign="top">Just lovin'' this shot</td>', 'Just lovin'' this shot', '2011-02-16 12:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317016, 934912, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very good detail shot of a street vendor (I am assuming) This would be best displayed as a part of a series or in a gallery or collection of photos to tell a story. I question the use of a shallow DoF here due to the fact no subject needed to be isolated from the background. I would''ve shot in f8 or higher. You can see the sharpest part of the image in the upper right hand area, so you kind of missed the focal point. Great color displayed and interesting rhythm, pattern and lines in the composition.</td>', 'Very good detail shot of a street vendor (I am assuming) This would be best displayed as a part of a series or in a gallery or collection of photos to tell a story. I question the use of a shallow DoF here due to the fact no subject needed to be isolated from the background. I would''ve shot in f8 or higher. You can see the sharpest part of the image in the upper right hand area, so you kind of missed the focal point. Great color displayed and interesting rhythm, pattern and lines in the composition.', '2011-02-16 13:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317018, 935610, 10785, '<td valign="top">His finger is kind of bent to the left...</td>', 'His finger is kind of bent to the left...', '2011-02-16 13:08:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317020, 936145, 10785, '<td valign="top">aka Hen''s a cluckin''... haha. Good exposure considering the darkness above and the bright, reflected light at the sidewalk. (Typically easy to deal with in post however this is minimal editing...)</td>', 'aka Hen''s a cluckin''... haha. Good exposure considering the darkness above and the bright, reflected light at the sidewalk. (Typically easy to deal with in post however this is minimal editing...)', '2011-02-16 13:11:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317023, 934991, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great Color, great exposure, and a person waaaaay down there in the distance to boot! It''s raw urban.</td>', 'Great Color, great exposure, and a person waaaaay down there in the distance to boot! It''s raw urban.', '2011-02-16 13:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317025, 935131, 10785, '<td valign="top">Overall this is very grey in tone. Everything blends in. I wish I could give a suggestion for what to do in camera other than adjusting exposure comensation to under or overexpose the scene. Perhaps not possible in this light.</td>', 'Overall this is very grey in tone. Everything blends in. I wish I could give a suggestion for what to do in camera other than adjusting exposure comensation to under or overexpose the scene. Perhaps not possible in this light.', '2011-02-16 13:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
