(6317260, 935109, 54833, '<td valign="top">Great shot! Love the silhouettes and the shadows.</td>', 'Great shot! Love the silhouettes and the shadows.', '2011-02-16 15:40:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317261, 935610, 54833, '<td valign="top">Too funny! Guess he didn''t want his picture taken, but ended up being a great shot anyway</td>', 'Too funny! Guess he didn''t want his picture taken, but ended up being a great shot anyway', '2011-02-16 15:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317263, 934991, 54833, '<td valign="top">Great photo, love the colors and the lighting. Just really well done</td>', 'Great photo, love the colors and the lighting. Just really well done', '2011-02-16 15:44:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317265, 935561, 54833, '<td valign="top">Way to be original! Cute idea</td>', 'Way to be original! Cute idea', '2011-02-16 15:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317271, 935772, 54833, '<td valign="top">Love the tilt, really adds to your shot</td>', 'Love the tilt, really adds to your shot', '2011-02-16 15:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317299, 936138, 30712, '<td valign="top">I have an idea of what you are setting out to achieve here - for me the in focus road and the out of focus figures doesn''t work.  I would have preferred to have had one person in focus with a very shallow depth of field.</td>', 'I have an idea of what you are setting out to achieve here - for me the in focus road and the out of focus figures doesn''t work.  I would have preferred to have had one person in focus with a very shallow depth of field.', '2011-02-16 16:21:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317300, 936062, 30712, '<td valign="top">A superb composition.  I can''t fault it.</td>', 'A superb composition.  I can''t fault it.', '2011-02-16 16:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317302, 936065, 30712, '<td valign="top">A delightful scene with so much colour and contrasting shapes.  And yet the shop keeper stands out as being central to the whole image.</td>', 'A delightful scene with so much colour and contrasting shapes.  And yet the shop keeper stands out as being central to the whole image.', '2011-02-16 16:23:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317307, 935109, 30712, '<td valign="top">Very well composed.  Beautifully executed.</td>', 'Very well composed.  Beautifully executed.', '2011-02-16 16:24:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317322, 935783, 113419, '<td valign="top">I like how the chimes try to take over the image but they just can''t hardly  push through the middle of the photo - NICE!</td>', 'I like how the chimes try to take over the image but they just can''t hardly  push through the middle of the photo - NICE!', '2011-02-16 16:38:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317323, 936062, 113419, '<td valign="top">very cool image</td>', 'very cool image', '2011-02-16 16:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317370, 936160, 124346, '<td valign="top">Nice sense of movement.  How do you call that tecnique?  (I''m from Venezuela, I know the name in spanish).</td>', 'Nice sense of movement.  How do you call that tecnique?  (I''m from Venezuela, I know the name in spanish).', '2011-02-16 17:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317389, 935298, 112828, '<td valign="top">Ohhhh if only that foot wasn''t so close to the bottom.  I love the repetition here, and I''m intrigued by that bottle in his hand, but I just feel the composition is a little too tight on the bottom, leading to a slightly unbalanced feeling.  Also, there seems to be a very minor (admittedly hard to deal with when shooting) CCW rotation.  *shrug* still, one of the better images I think.</td>', 'Ohhhh if only that foot wasn''t so close to the bottom.  I love the repetition here, and I''m intrigued by that bottle in his hand, but I just feel the composition is a little too tight on the bottom, leading to a slightly unbalanced feeling.  Also, there seems to be a very minor (admittedly hard to deal with when shooting) CCW rotation.  *shrug* still, one of the better images I think.', '2011-02-16 17:20:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317403, 935760, 124346, '<td valign="top">I would''be used another framing (not sure this is the correct word), I would cut the picture just below the "square" word.</td>', 'I would''be used another framing (not sure this is the correct word), I would cut the picture just below the "square" word.', '2011-02-16 17:27:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317410, 936138, 124346, '<td valign="top">It could be better.</td>', 'It could be better.', '2011-02-16 17:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317545, 935774, 123825, '<td valign="top">Love the colors!</td>', 'Love the colors!', '2011-02-16 19:40:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317566, 935109, 123825, '<td valign="top">Love the feeling this evokes!</td>', 'Love the feeling this evokes!', '2011-02-16 19:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317692, 935109, 114285, '<td valign="top">Cute.</td>', 'Cute.', '2011-02-16 20:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317693, 935623, 114285, '<td valign="top">Nice, love the soft focus.</td>', 'Nice, love the soft focus.', '2011-02-16 20:37:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317694, 936018, 114285, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, love the mood.</td>', 'Nice shot, love the mood.', '2011-02-16 20:37:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317697, 936068, 114285, '<td valign="top">Great shot, top 10.</td>', 'Great shot, top 10.', '2011-02-16 20:38:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317698, 936099, 114285, '<td valign="top">My pick for the bluey, very creative shot.</td>', 'My pick for the bluey, very creative shot.', '2011-02-16 20:40:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317699, 935704, 114285, '<td valign="top">Cheap bananas, ours have gone up due to the floods in QLD. Colourful shot.</td>', 'Cheap bananas, ours have gone up due to the floods in QLD. Colourful shot.', '2011-02-16 20:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317798, 935853, 105333, '<td valign="top">Great characters in this shot.  Each one has a different story to tell.</td>', 'Great characters in this shot.  Each one has a different story to tell.', '2011-02-16 21:14:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317803, 935837, 105333, '<td valign="top">What a unique subject.</td>', 'What a unique subject.', '2011-02-16 21:15:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317804, 934746, 105333, '<td valign="top">What a great group of men.</td>', 'What a great group of men.', '2011-02-16 21:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317811, 934596, 97225, '<td valign="top">Sad reminder and a fascinating sign. I take it that Jason O. Crandall was the victim of another intoxicated driver, but it is ambiguous and open to the interpretation that he was intoxicated himself. If I were his family I would not want this to be misinterpreted if the fault were not his.</td>', 'Sad reminder and a fascinating sign. I take it that Jason O. Crandall was the victim of another intoxicated driver, but it is ambiguous and open to the interpretation that he was intoxicated himself. If I were his family I would not want this to be misinterpreted if the fault were not his.', '2011-02-16 21:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317819, 935526, 105333, '<td valign="top">Sad that nobody is paying any attention to him.</td>', 'Sad that nobody is paying any attention to him.', '2011-02-16 21:21:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317826, 936068, 97225, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Fascinating how the snow on the cars indicates the relative time they have been there. I like the blurry two-legged dog and his person - it looks like they are not going to waste too much time on walkies in the cold.</td>', 'Great shot. Fascinating how the snow on the cars indicates the relative time they have been there. I like the blurry two-legged dog and his person - it looks like they are not going to waste too much time on walkies in the cold.', '2011-02-16 21:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317829, 936041, 105333, '<td valign="top">Great textures.</td>', 'Great textures.', '2011-02-16 21:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317832, 936162, 105333, '<td valign="top">What a cooperative model.</td>', 'What a cooperative model.', '2011-02-16 21:27:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317834, 936047, 105333, '<td valign="top">One of the reasons people shy away from street photography is getting looks like that.</td>', 'One of the reasons people shy away from street photography is getting looks like that.', '2011-02-16 21:27:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317836, 934917, 105333, '<td valign="top">Love the framing.</td>', 'Love the framing.', '2011-02-16 21:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317840, 936080, 105333, '<td valign="top">What a great capture although I wish the people weren''t in the middle and were rather walking into the frame.</td>', 'What a great capture although I wish the people weren''t in the middle and were rather walking into the frame.', '2011-02-16 21:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317847, 936156, 105333, '<td valign="top">Snapped atthe perfect moment.</td>', 'Snapped atthe perfect moment.', '2011-02-16 21:32:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317850, 936032, 105333, '<td valign="top">I can''t believe he put his camera down to read a text, what if he missed the perfect shot :)</td>', 'I can''t believe he put his camera down to read a text, what if he missed the perfect shot :)', '2011-02-16 21:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317856, 935975, 105333, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast.</td>', 'I like the contrast.', '2011-02-16 21:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317863, 934991, 105333, '<td valign="top">What happens in the alley stays in the alley.</td>', 'What happens in the alley stays in the alley.', '2011-02-16 21:35:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317864, 934707, 105333, '<td valign="top">Love the blur.</td>', 'Love the blur.', '2011-02-16 21:36:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317865, 935772, 105333, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle.</td>', 'Interesting angle.', '2011-02-16 21:37:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317868, 935186, 105333, '<td valign="top">What an interesting street performer.</td>', 'What an interesting street performer.', '2011-02-16 21:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317870, 935623, 105333, '<td valign="top">Great shot.</td>', 'Great shot.', '2011-02-16 21:38:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317873, 935569, 105333, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.</td>', 'Nice colors.', '2011-02-16 21:38:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317884, 934843, 105333, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF.</td>', 'Nice DOF.', '2011-02-16 21:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317888, 935075, 105333, '<td valign="top">Love the focus, he just jumps right out at you.</td>', 'Love the focus, he just jumps right out at you.', '2011-02-16 21:41:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317908, 935584, 114225, '<td valign="top">Quite the character. One thing this photo needs is less highlights in the face. It''s very distracting and takes away from the textures of the skin. For a minimal challenge, I would suggest bracketing your exposures so you can pick the one that looks best.</td>', 'Quite the character. One thing this photo needs is less highlights in the face. It''s very distracting and takes away from the textures of the skin. For a minimal challenge, I would suggest bracketing your exposures so you can pick the one that looks best.', '2011-02-16 22:12:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317909, 935623, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting how you have the soft dreamy like feeling. Is you lens fogged? I do think it works nicely as an dded touch (even if unintentional).</td>', 'Interesting how you have the soft dreamy like feeling. Is you lens fogged? I do think it works nicely as an dded touch (even if unintentional).', '2011-02-16 22:13:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317910, 936003, 114225, '<td valign="top">Is this a hip shot photo? I bet you wish you could have straightened it in post processing.</td>', 'Is this a hip shot photo? I bet you wish you could have straightened it in post processing.', '2011-02-16 22:14:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317911, 934917, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how the two girls outside are so entranced by what''s going on. That really helps tell a story.</td>', 'I like how the two girls outside are so entranced by what''s going on. That really helps tell a story.', '2011-02-16 22:14:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317915, 935590, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great use of depth of field and very nice sharpness. I can''t tell if the man is getting a newspaper or hiding from the camera.</td>', 'Great use of depth of field and very nice sharpness. I can''t tell if the man is getting a newspaper or hiding from the camera.', '2011-02-16 22:16:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317917, 935426, 114225, '<td valign="top">Some good story telling in this photo.</td>', 'Some good story telling in this photo.', '2011-02-16 22:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317920, 935051, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great title. The photo itself is ok, but your creative title kicks it up a notch.</td>', 'Great title. The photo itself is ok, but your creative title kicks it up a notch.', '2011-02-16 22:21:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317921, 935277, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy that you can see from the look on his face how much he enjoys what he does.</td>', 'I really enjoy that you can see from the look on his face how much he enjoys what he does.', '2011-02-16 22:23:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317922, 935075, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this photo, and what it stands for. Just every day normal life, captured in a pleasant way.</td>', 'I like this photo, and what it stands for. Just every day normal life, captured in a pleasant way.', '2011-02-16 22:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317923, 936138, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice use of depth of field to add interest to the photo.</td>', 'Nice use of depth of field to add interest to the photo.', '2011-02-16 22:26:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317927, 934746, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Great candid shot.</td>', 'Nice shot. Great candid shot.', '2011-02-16 22:41:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317928, 935975, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. Excellent composition.</td>', 'Very nice shot. Excellent composition.', '2011-02-16 22:42:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317929, 936033, 23484, '<td valign="top">Nice crisp image. Good street scene.</td>', 'Nice crisp image. Good street scene.', '2011-02-16 22:43:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317932, 936099, 23484, '<td valign="top">Very abstract. Cool pose.</td>', 'Very abstract. Cool pose.', '2011-02-16 22:45:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317959, 935975, 36843, '<td valign="top">nice</td>', 'nice', '2011-02-16 23:10:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317976, 935853, 36843, '<td valign="top">nice mood, love it</td>', 'nice mood, love it', '2011-02-16 23:17:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317978, 935799, 36843, '<td valign="top">this is differant, i like it</td>', 'this is differant, i like it', '2011-02-16 23:18:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6317991, 935251, 108580, '<td valign="top">I wonder what the Arabic says! Nice street shot. What gets me about these placard  carrying &lt;enter adjective here&gt; is there''s always someone else willing to put life on the line for their ideals...</td>', 'I wonder what the Arabic says! Nice street shot. What gets me about these placard  carrying <enter adjective here> is there''s always someone else willing to put life on the line for their ideals...', '2011-02-16 23:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318184, 936024, 105333, '<td valign="top">So much activity in this.  I cen feel the hustle and bustle of the street.</td>', 'So much activity in this.  I cen feel the hustle and bustle of the street.', '2011-02-17 02:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318186, 935298, 105333, '<td valign="top">There is something about the position of the head under the nose that bothers me.</td>', 'There is something about the position of the head under the nose that bothers me.', '2011-02-17 02:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318187, 936160, 105333, '<td valign="top">A little too blurry.  Amazing how fast those cyclists can go.</td>', 'A little too blurry.  Amazing how fast those cyclists can go.', '2011-02-17 02:48:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318189, 935851, 105333, '<td valign="top">I can barely see the person walking in the fog. Very moody.</td>', 'I can barely see the person walking in the fog. Very moody.', '2011-02-17 02:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318190, 936086, 105333, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on the subject.</td>', 'Interesting take on the subject.', '2011-02-17 02:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318192, 936163, 105333, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark.  It is had to read the words which should be popping out.</td>', 'A bit too dark.  It is had to read the words which should be popping out.', '2011-02-17 02:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318193, 935590, 105333, '<td valign="top">Interesting framing with the post replacing the person''s other leg.</td>', 'Interesting framing with the post replacing the person''s other leg.', '2011-02-17 02:53:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318195, 936104, 105333, '<td valign="top">They seem oblivious to you very natural.</td>', 'They seem oblivious to you very natural.', '2011-02-17 02:55:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318199, 936001, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!  I''d like a little more space above the top of her head but that''s my only criticism.  One of my top picks for the challenge.</td>', 'Nicely done!  I''d like a little more space above the top of her head but that''s my only criticism.  One of my top picks for the challenge.', '2011-02-17 03:33:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318200, 935122, 16148, '<td valign="top">Very nice and the soft tones work for me.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice and the soft tones work for me.  Good luck!', '2011-02-17 03:34:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318202, 935518, 16148, '<td valign="top">Interesting series of repeating shapes leading to your subject.</td>', 'Interesting series of repeating shapes leading to your subject.', '2011-02-17 03:36:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318203, 935851, 16148, '<td valign="top">I enjoy shooting in these conditions.  Well done!</td>', 'I enjoy shooting in these conditions.  Well done!', '2011-02-17 03:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318205, 935298, 16148, '<td valign="top">Very nice entry that should do well.  Might be better one or two step later so he is not directly under the wall portraits nose.  Good luck!</td>', 'Very nice entry that should do well.  Might be better one or two step later so he is not directly under the wall portraits nose.  Good luck!', '2011-02-17 03:46:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318208, 935760, 16148, '<td valign="top">I really like the lines and shadows you have captured here.</td>', 'I really like the lines and shadows you have captured here.', '2011-02-17 03:47:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318210, 935961, 16148, '<td valign="top">Great shot and story.  I wish you hadn''t cut off her right foot but this is still very nice.</td>', 'Great shot and story.  I wish you hadn''t cut off her right foot but this is still very nice.', '2011-02-17 03:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318213, 936083, 16148, '<td valign="top">Interesting image to study.  I like the positioning of your characters and their posture.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Interesting image to study.  I like the positioning of your characters and their posture.  Nicely done.', '2011-02-17 03:54:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318214, 936041, 16148, '<td valign="top">Nice alley with great textures and something of interest at the end.  Good luck!</td>', 'Nice alley with great textures and something of interest at the end.  Good luck!', '2011-02-17 03:56:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318215, 935623, 16148, '<td valign="top">A little soft but maybe that was you intent.  I like the lush green surroundings and the women in stylish black clothing.</td>', 'A little soft but maybe that was you intent.  I like the lush green surroundings and the women in stylish black clothing.', '2011-02-17 03:59:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318240, 935704, 68573, '<td valign="top">great capture</td>', 'great capture', '2011-02-17 06:08:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318288, 936004, 10785, '<td valign="top">Good angle on the subject. It''s a little centered in the frame, using rule of thirds would add interest. It seems to be overexposed and washed out.</td>', 'Good angle on the subject. It''s a little centered in the frame, using rule of thirds would add interest. It seems to be overexposed and washed out.', '2011-02-17 08:09:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318289, 936109, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very interesting scene captured. Good action with the crowd and I like it in color, especially with the deep red of the building facade. It needs to be sharpened up a bit in post. It doesn''t really seem to be out of focus, just a little unsharp. Also I would pump up the contrast a bit in your camera settings if possible. I would love to see this in the challenge outtakes processed using basic or advanced editing rules.</td>', 'Very interesting scene captured. Good action with the crowd and I like it in color, especially with the deep red of the building facade. It needs to be sharpened up a bit in post. It doesn''t really seem to be out of focus, just a little unsharp. Also I would pump up the contrast a bit in your camera settings if possible. I would love to see this in the challenge outtakes processed using basic or advanced editing rules.', '2011-02-17 08:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318291, 936162, 10785, '<td valign="top">Great color, excellent exposure. It looks like a dark area without much reflected light, but you got the subject nice and bright.</td>', 'Great color, excellent exposure. It looks like a dark area without much reflected light, but you got the subject nice and bright.', '2011-02-17 08:14:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318292, 935623, 10785, '<td valign="top">The soft focus is something you don''t expect in street photography. It is well done here. I read somewhere that in color photography, a lot of greens comes across as kind of grey or dull to the eye. Some added red colors would have helped. The subject is definitely captured well and composed well with rule of thirds and the soft focus sets the emotion for the scene... kind of an isolated solitude.</td>', 'The soft focus is something you don''t expect in street photography. It is well done here. I read somewhere that in color photography, a lot of greens comes across as kind of grey or dull to the eye. Some added red colors would have helped. The subject is definitely captured well and composed well with rule of thirds and the soft focus sets the emotion for the scene... kind of an isolated solitude.', '2011-02-17 08:18:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318299, 936099, 10785, '<td valign="top">No challenge details means no DNMC to me. What a fun and quirky idea to show the sense of street in a home portrait studio setting.</td>', 'No challenge details means no DNMC to me. What a fun and quirky idea to show the sense of street in a home portrait studio setting.', '2011-02-17 08:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318301, 935799, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection!</td>', 'Nice reflection!', '2011-02-17 08:27:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318327, 936099, 128166, '<td valign="top">If this was really one the street it would be good, however, it looks like it is in the studio. To me this is not street photography, of course I could be wrong, but if it was on the street it would be especially interesting to see something of that too.</td>', 'If this was really one the street it would be good, however, it looks like it is in the studio. To me this is not street photography, of course I could be wrong, but if it was on the street it would be especially interesting to see something of that too.', '2011-02-17 09:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6318328, 935959, 128166, '<td valign="top">Nice photo, but it doesn''t scream street photography to me.</td>', 'Nice photo, but it doesn''t scream street photography to me.', '2011-02-17 09:02:53.000000', NULL, 1);
