(6319195, 936099, 122131, '<td valign="top">This is rather amazing, and it''s certainly THE photo that stands out from the bunch.....<br/>HOWEVER.. Whilst the photo itself is as amazingly taken, great composed, perfectly lighted as it is..... Perhaps from a personal point of view, I would have liked to have seen more on top of the umbrella.<br/>It feels like the shot just ''ends'' there, but it gives me the feeling that there is more to be seen..<br/>Save from that little nudge, the image itself is as close to a perfect example as it can get.<br/>10.</td>', 'This is rather amazing, and it''s certainly THE photo that stands out from the bunch.....HOWEVER.. Whilst the photo itself is as amazingly taken, great composed, perfectly lighted as it is..... Perhaps from a personal point of view, I would have liked to have seen more on top of the umbrella.It feels like the shot just ''ends'' there, but it gives me the feeling that there is more to be seen..Save from that little nudge, the image itself is as close to a perfect example as it can get.10.', '2011-02-17 21:02:03.000000', NULL, 1),
