(6319785, 935584, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks a little familiar, I *think* have a few pics of him in my own DPC portfolio. Nice guy, too. Since this isn''t my own entry and I know it''s not <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_F.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=116574" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Cowtownmom</a>''s, I''m fairly sure this is from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=554" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">David Ey</a>. Nice to see someone else entering pics from the stockyards. The place has been a gold mine for me.<br/> <br/>Added: Since David PM''d me thinking this was my wife''s entry and it''s not, my best next guess is that this is from <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/31.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=80061" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Firefighter271</a>.</td>', 'Looks a little familiar, I *think* have a few pics of him in my own DPC portfolio. Nice guy, too. Since this isn''t my own entry and I know it''s not  Cowtownmom''s, I''m fairly sure this is from  David Ey. Nice to see someone else entering pics from the stockyards. The place has been a gold mine for me. Added: Since David PM''d me thinking this was my wife''s entry and it''s not, my best next guess is that this is from  Firefighter271.', '2011-02-18 10:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
