(6325524, 934851, 104230, '<td valign="top">I love this. The woman has such an interesting face, and of course the pink is great too. But more than that, I get a wonderful sense of "intersecting planes" from the two directions of movement; plus each of the three people has either an arm or a leg pointing to the lower right, which provides a unifying theme to this street image.</td>', 'I love this. The woman has such an interesting face, and of course the pink is great too. But more than that, I get a wonderful sense of "intersecting planes" from the two directions of movement; plus each of the three people has either an arm or a leg pointing to the lower right, which provides a unifying theme to this street image.', '2011-02-21 19:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(6325675, 935426, 128028, '<td valign="top">A very gripping picture and thought.</td>', 'A very gripping picture and thought.', '2011-02-21 21:02:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6325686, 935774, 128028, '<td valign="top">I love the contrast of the color of the unobserved artwork with the drabness of the ladies cloths.</td>', 'I love the contrast of the color of the unobserved artwork with the drabness of the ladies cloths.', '2011-02-21 21:05:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6325707, 936001, 128028, '<td valign="top">I like the use of light and shadows.</td>', 'I like the use of light and shadows.', '2011-02-21 21:11:58.000000', NULL, 1),
