(6327629, 934746, 96751, '<td valign="top">Fabulous balance in this image.</td>', 'Fabulous balance in this image.', '2011-02-22 22:35:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327633, 934707, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love the motion blur, and how the two guys stand out against the horizontal motion.</td>', 'Love the motion blur, and how the two guys stand out against the horizontal motion.', '2011-02-22 22:35:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327640, 935772, 96751, '<td valign="top">Not sure the tilt helps this.  I''d have liked to have seen more of the sign above the man, which could almost be his name.</td>', 'Not sure the tilt helps this.  I''d have liked to have seen more of the sign above the man, which could almost be his name.', '2011-02-22 22:37:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327642, 934843, 96751, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t look like the pooch is biting....</td>', 'Doesn''t look like the pooch is biting....', '2011-02-22 22:38:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327644, 935704, 96751, '<td valign="top">Great street shop!  Love those bananas.</td>', 'Great street shop!  Love those bananas.', '2011-02-22 22:38:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327647, 934917, 96751, '<td valign="top">A terrific image but <i>looks</i> totally staged.</td>', 'A terrific image but looks totally staged.', '2011-02-22 22:39:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327648, 935961, 96751, '<td valign="top">She''s all, you didn''t just take my picture, did you?</td>', 'She''s all, you didn''t just take my picture, did you?', '2011-02-22 22:39:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327649, 935518, 96751, '<td valign="top">Wonderful depth.  Don''t know that the top lights are necessary.</td>', 'Wonderful depth.  Don''t know that the top lights are necessary.', '2011-02-22 22:39:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327655, 935799, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is the first image that stopped me in my tracks.  Certainly, the reflection/light thing in her hand drew my eye, but the the pp''ing made me wonder - is this a hurricane happening, a blizzard?  There is such texture in the air, and delicacy in the tree.  LOVE this.  Something is definitely afoot here...</td>', 'This is the first image that stopped me in my tracks.  Certainly, the reflection/light thing in her hand drew my eye, but the the pp''ing made me wonder - is this a hurricane happening, a blizzard?  There is such texture in the air, and delicacy in the tree.  LOVE this.  Something is definitely afoot here...', '2011-02-22 22:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327658, 936080, 96751, '<td valign="top">A most curious image, like a Quaker sandwich.</td>', 'A most curious image, like a Quaker sandwich.', '2011-02-22 22:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327660, 935236, 96751, '<td valign="top">The turned Priscilla into a play???!!!!!</td>', 'The turned Priscilla into a play???!!!!!', '2011-02-22 22:42:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327663, 935298, 96751, '<td valign="top">Such a great image.  A kiss from Charlie.  And this guy didn''t even notice.  Love the mystery/uncertainty of the dark opening this unaware man is headed for.</td>', 'Such a great image.  A kiss from Charlie.  And this guy didn''t even notice.  Love the mystery/uncertainty of the dark opening this unaware man is headed for.', '2011-02-22 22:43:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327666, 935277, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is just BEGGING to be in b/w.  What a marvelous, quirky, happy capture.</td>', 'This is just BEGGING to be in b/w.  What a marvelous, quirky, happy capture.', '2011-02-22 22:44:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327667, 935851, 96751, '<td valign="top">I could sit here and look at this for hours.  The fog plays such games with the eyes - I look here and there is nothing, but I see something over there.  And when I go there, it sinks into the fog, only for something else to emerge elsewhere.  And the figure... coming or going?  Is it day turning into night, or night giving way to day.  Sigh...</td>', 'I could sit here and look at this for hours.  The fog plays such games with the eyes - I look here and there is nothing, but I see something over there.  And when I go there, it sinks into the fog, only for something else to emerge elsewhere.  And the figure... coming or going?  Is it day turning into night, or night giving way to day.  Sigh...', '2011-02-22 22:45:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327669, 935297, 96751, '<td valign="top">For me there is just too much going on here, too many elements clamoring for center stage.   Is it the long iron fence on the left?  The opera house?  The street lights?  The x-shaped structure?  The blur of people.  The blur of cars????  Don''t know where to look.</td>', 'For me there is just too much going on here, too many elements clamoring for center stage.   Is it the long iron fence on the left?  The opera house?  The street lights?  The x-shaped structure?  The blur of people.  The blur of cars????  Don''t know where to look.', '2011-02-22 22:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327671, 936145, 96751, '<td valign="top">This looks like Pasadena...</td>', 'This looks like Pasadena...', '2011-02-22 22:47:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327673, 935975, 96751, '<td valign="top">Could this BE any more classic?????   I don''t think so.  Unfair advantage of quaint, narrow, antique streets.</td>', 'Could this BE any more classic?????   I don''t think so.  Unfair advantage of quaint, narrow, antique streets.', '2011-02-22 22:48:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327676, 935853, 96751, '<td valign="top">Lovely night shot.</td>', 'Lovely night shot.', '2011-02-22 22:48:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327678, 936065, 96751, '<td valign="top">We almost don''t see him amidst the clutter!!!</td>', 'We almost don''t see him amidst the clutter!!!', '2011-02-22 22:49:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327681, 935186, 96751, '<td valign="top">Amazing what some folks will do for "a living".  Gorgeous conversion.</td>', 'Amazing what some folks will do for "a living".  Gorgeous conversion.', '2011-02-22 22:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327683, 935778, 96751, '<td valign="top">The tilt is annoying the heck out of me.</td>', 'The tilt is annoying the heck out of me.', '2011-02-22 22:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327685, 935426, 96751, '<td valign="top">Love that we can see both the sparkling new above, and the refuse below.</td>', 'Love that we can see both the sparkling new above, and the refuse below.', '2011-02-22 22:50:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327686, 935623, 96751, '<td valign="top">Not sure about the blur...</td>', 'Not sure about the blur...', '2011-02-22 22:51:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327687, 936024, 96751, '<td valign="top">Not getting the title, but a very cool pov.</td>', 'Not getting the title, but a very cool pov.', '2011-02-22 22:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327691, 935837, 96751, '<td valign="top">AWWWWWWWW!!!!  Incoming!  What a great shot.  The lighting is terrific, his placement in the image (ROT), all those leading lines, and of course, those SHADOWS!!!!!!  LOVE it.</td>', 'AWWWWWWWW!!!!  Incoming!  What a great shot.  The lighting is terrific, his placement in the image (ROT), all those leading lines, and of course, those SHADOWS!!!!!!  LOVE it.', '2011-02-22 22:52:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327694, 936062, 96751, '<td valign="top">Cool silhouettes!</td>', 'Cool silhouettes!', '2011-02-22 22:52:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327696, 935610, 96751, '<td valign="top">Ok, THAT''s in your face...</td>', 'Ok, THAT''s in your face...', '2011-02-22 22:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327697, 934851, 96751, '<td valign="top">THAT, my friends, is the look of a New Yorker.</td>', 'THAT, my friends, is the look of a New Yorker.', '2011-02-22 22:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327698, 935521, 96751, '<td valign="top">There is a longing about this image I cannot define.  The solidity of the rock wall vs. the frailty of the woman with her walker?  The way the sun seems to have passed her by in favor of the wall.  The half-hidden someone seemingly waiting for her to arrive?  Beautiful.</td>', 'There is a longing about this image I cannot define.  The solidity of the rock wall vs. the frailty of the woman with her walker?  The way the sun seems to have passed her by in favor of the wall.  The half-hidden someone seemingly waiting for her to arrive?  Beautiful.', '2011-02-22 22:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327699, 936018, 96751, '<td valign="top">Stunning chiaroscuro.  Just a bit too far away.</td>', 'Stunning chiaroscuro.  Just a bit too far away.', '2011-02-22 22:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327700, 936001, 96751, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why, but this has a very <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">melethia</a> feel to it.  Just gorgeous, even if you are not her :-)</td>', 'I don''t know why, but this has a very  melethia feel to it.  Just gorgeous, even if you are not her :-)', '2011-02-22 22:55:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6327702, 935760, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love how the shadows are spilling down the stairs.  Incredible leading lines.  I think you could have cropped out everything above the light and made it even better.</td>', 'I love how the shadows are spilling down the stairs.  Incredible leading lines.  I think you could have cropped out everything above the light and made it even better.', '2011-02-22 22:57:25.000000', NULL, 1),
