(6327869, 935610, 83313, '<td valign="top">Probably got hurt because of the gesture, but that is also the appeal of this shot. It''s in your face and unapologetic real life. One of my 10''s.</td>', 'Probably got hurt because of the gesture, but that is also the appeal of this shot. It''s in your face and unapologetic real life. One of my 10''s.', '2011-02-23 00:25:57.000000', NULL, 0),
