(6328356, 934851, 10785, '<td valign="top">Nice capture! I took some lessons from you regarding proximity to subject and can see how you use the wider focus up close in this picture as well as the others you showed me. This deserved a much higher score. You did so well with the commenters votes. Would have been good for you to hear from those who were lower in their voting. I voted you a 6. The blur did not deter me from liking it. I thought it was slightly grey and lacked some contrast. You can pump it up in post for your collection!</td>', 'Nice capture! I took some lessons from you regarding proximity to subject and can see how you use the wider focus up close in this picture as well as the others you showed me. This deserved a much higher score. You did so well with the commenters votes. Would have been good for you to hear from those who were lower in their voting. I voted you a 6. The blur did not deter me from liking it. I thought it was slightly grey and lacked some contrast. You can pump it up in post for your collection!', '2011-02-23 08:27:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6328368, 935298, 86447, '<td valign="top">Top Ten!   Congrats, Ben!</td>', 'Top Ten!   Congrats, Ben!', '2011-02-23 08:32:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6328386, 935975, 117474, '<td valign="top">I prefer this one to the alternative, purely because of the people going in opposite directions, and that their heads were slightly inclined towards each other. Gives a sense of realism towards it.<br/>However... I preferred the perspective of the other. A happy in-between would be excellent :) <br/>I hit this with an 8.</td>', 'I prefer this one to the alternative, purely because of the people going in opposite directions, and that their heads were slightly inclined towards each other. Gives a sense of realism towards it.However... I preferred the perspective of the other. A happy in-between would be excellent :) I hit this with an 8.', '2011-02-23 08:43:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(6328413, 935837, 63218, '<td valign="top">This is my pick for the Blue. Love that serious, determined face. I love shadows, so for me it''s a composition of shadows that perfectly set off your subject. Nothing but praise &amp; admiration. Except for one thing: I came back to read your comments &amp; there aren''t any! Quick! it''s not too late!</td>', 'This is my pick for the Blue. Love that serious, determined face. I love shadows, so for me it''s a composition of shadows that perfectly set off your subject. Nothing but praise & admiration. Except for one thing: I came back to read your comments & there aren''t any! Quick! it''s not too late!', '2011-02-23 08:54:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6328418, 934851, 30982, '<td valign="top">Tbis was my pick of the challenge - sorry I didn''t get back for comments before voting ended.</td>', 'Tbis was my pick of the challenge - sorry I didn''t get back for comments before voting ended.', '2011-02-23 08:56:15.000000', NULL, 0),
