(6328510, 935277, 112739, '<td valign="top">Coongrats on doing so well in this challenge Richard. I know we both were a bit out of our comfort zone with this. I was up at Pearl St on Sat afternoon, I think you may have been there either Friday or Sat morning. This same poem writer was there on Sat PM too. I took about 700 shots that day. As I passed him, he smiled at me and I''m thinking he knew what I was up to. I think it''s great he wrote a poem for you!</td>', 'Coongrats on doing so well in this challenge Richard. I know we both were a bit out of our comfort zone with this. I was up at Pearl St on Sat afternoon, I think you may have been there either Friday or Sat morning. This same poem writer was there on Sat PM too. I took about 700 shots that day. As I passed him, he smiled at me and I''m thinking he knew what I was up to. I think it''s great he wrote a poem for you!', '2011-02-23 09:54:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6328591, 936156, 66641, '<td valign="top">Top 10!! I''m THRILLED!!  Thanks so much! :D</td>', 'Top 10!! I''m THRILLED!!  Thanks so much! :D', '2011-02-23 10:38:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6328603, 935853, 60047, '<td valign="top">I remember going inside this bookstore about twenty-five years ago. This shot really brings back memories.<br/> <br/>Great shot. Congrats on the blue.</td>', 'I remember going inside this bookstore about twenty-five years ago. This shot really brings back memories. Great shot. Congrats on the blue.', '2011-02-23 10:45:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(6328699, 935610, 61961, '<td valign="top">I thought this was one of the best shots in the challenge: the dirty, weathered hand is sharp, and although blurred the camo clothing, long hair and red face point to a life on the street.  You managed to get a blue sky, too.<br/> <br/>The homeless as subject for photography is such a cliché that even saying it''s cliché is cliché.  Here his anonymity is respected.  His angry gesture is the perfect response to someone pointing a camera at him, but softened by the smile, which makes this picture kind of a joy.</td>', 'I thought this was one of the best shots in the challenge: the dirty, weathered hand is sharp, and although blurred the camo clothing, long hair and red face point to a life on the street.  You managed to get a blue sky, too. The homeless as subject for photography is such a cliché that even saying it''s cliché is cliché.  Here his anonymity is respected.  His angry gesture is the perfect response to someone pointing a camera at him, but softened by the smile, which makes this picture kind of a joy.', '2011-02-23 11:26:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6328716, 935610, 50618, '<td valign="top">I''m really surprised this didn''t do better.</td>', 'I''m really surprised this didn''t do better.', '2011-02-23 11:35:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6328748, 935853, 69008, '<td valign="top">The choices in camera settings and the effect of  the sharpening give this a nice edge that works very nicely with the subject and existing lighting.  <br/> The scene is classic, even to the title of the store, and the people add quite a diversity of interesting little side shows to the overall enjoyment of viewing the image.  <br/>Congrats on the new "Blue".</td>', 'The choices in camera settings and the effect of  the sharpening give this a nice edge that works very nicely with the subject and existing lighting.   The scene is classic, even to the title of the store, and the people add quite a diversity of interesting little side shows to the overall enjoyment of viewing the image.  Congrats on the new "Blue".', '2011-02-23 11:53:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6328799, 935975, 119747, '<td valign="top">This is awesome, and no editing as well makes it that bit better. great one</td>', 'This is awesome, and no editing as well makes it that bit better. great one', '2011-02-23 12:12:05.000000', NULL, 0),
