(6328811, 935975, 12733, '<td valign="top">Good choice. I think the sign on the building and the two guys passing add a lot by creating a kind of mystery. Do they know each other? What kind of a place is La Diner de Vigeur? Are either, or both,going in? Probably neither is associated, and the place is just an ordinary restaurant - but the deatails stop the viewer, at least for a moment. Both are great shots.<br/>Dave</td>', 'Good choice. I think the sign on the building and the two guys passing add a lot by creating a kind of mystery. Do they know each other? What kind of a place is La Diner de Vigeur? Are either, or both,going in? Probably neither is associated, and the place is just an ordinary restaurant - but the deatails stop the viewer, at least for a moment. Both are great shots.Dave', '2011-02-23 12:17:48.000000', NULL, 0),
