(6328912, 936094, 49773, '<td valign="top">Although you''ve mentioned your subject is centered I don''t really consider this guy a subject of the photo (other than he''s a person, which should make him more dominant than the car?).</td>', 'Although you''ve mentioned your subject is centered I don''t really consider this guy a subject of the photo (other than he''s a person, which should make him more dominant than the car?).', '2011-02-23 13:22:00.000000', NULL, 0),
