(6329742, 936094, 76335, '<td valign="top">I agree about getting closer. The car may be a distraction but it does help to balance the composition. In fact, it''s very nicely composed and framed. Framing is the challenge when getting up close and working at wider focal lengths. Keep it up though... <br/> <br/>And thanks for the comment on my own image!</td>', 'I agree about getting closer. The car may be a distraction but it does help to balance the composition. In fact, it''s very nicely composed and framed. Framing is the challenge when getting up close and working at wider focal lengths. Keep it up though...  And thanks for the comment on my own image!', '2011-02-23 20:47:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6329987, 934851, 68504, '<td valign="top">Only glanced at this challenge (not voting), and this one stood out for many miles - of course it is yours, I just never thought my cousin Miriam would be starring in Pittsburgh.  I''ve been meaning to tell her to stop dying her hair black, but I must say it goes with the pink.  Utterly fascinating portraiture, I feel totally involved.</td>', 'Only glanced at this challenge (not voting), and this one stood out for many miles - of course it is yours, I just never thought my cousin Miriam would be starring in Pittsburgh.  I''ve been meaning to tell her to stop dying her hair black, but I must say it goes with the pink.  Utterly fascinating portraiture, I feel totally involved.', '2011-02-23 21:56:39.000000', NULL, 0),
