(6333466, 936033, 115345, '<td valign="top">this one jumps straight out at me.  Strong sense of story and emotion.  Great capture of expression and body language. Would have been one of my top picks, well done.</td>', 'this one jumps straight out at me.  Strong sense of story and emotion.  Great capture of expression and body language. Would have been one of my top picks, well done.', '2011-02-26 21:55:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(6333470, 934858, 115345, '<td valign="top">a strong, imaginative image.</td>', 'a strong, imaginative image.', '2011-02-26 22:03:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(6333474, 934851, 115345, '<td valign="top">I think that is a really strong image and deserved a way better result.  More than the woman''s expression which is a good capture in itself you have created a tangible impression of tension and story by the slight panning blur in the background and around the foreground woman''s hair that oozes a sense of action or purpose in all the participants.  The woman behind with the bag has a strong effect drawing attention to the lady in the foreground.  This shot for me is a beauty!</td>', 'I think that is a really strong image and deserved a way better result.  More than the woman''s expression which is a good capture in itself you have created a tangible impression of tension and story by the slight panning blur in the background and around the foreground woman''s hair that oozes a sense of action or purpose in all the participants.  The woman behind with the bag has a strong effect drawing attention to the lady in the foreground.  This shot for me is a beauty!', '2011-02-26 22:10:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(6333478, 935799, 115345, '<td valign="top">this is a really good image and deserved in my opinion a much higher rank.  Strong sense of story.  I also am curious about the distortion (which really adds to the image) water? vaseline on the lens?  Whatever it works well in this shot.</td>', 'this is a really good image and deserved in my opinion a much higher rank.  Strong sense of story.  I also am curious about the distortion (which really adds to the image) water? vaseline on the lens?  Whatever it works well in this shot.', '2011-02-26 22:15:43.000000', NULL, 0),
